    """ Represents a Touch Analysis builder. 
        The Touch analysis will be performed on selected Sheet or Solid Bodies.
        Impacting areas of body will be computed as per selected standard. These bodies are then given 
        to contact analysis for radius analysis. 
        The Output for the Touch Analysis will be impacting areas validation and analysis result """


